    <p>You are responsible for how you use a downloaded image and for following applicable laws and platform terms.</p>

    <h2>Availability and limitations</h2>
    <p>The tool relies on images supplied by YouTube. A thumbnail may be unavailable, change over time, or exist only at a smaller size. Browser and network restrictions can also affect previews and downloads.</p>
    <p>We aim to keep the tool useful, but do not promise uninterrupted access or a particular image resolution. Features may change as browser behavior and image availability change.</p>

